{"id":"wb-8-402","name":"大颠祖师塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大颠祖师塔","text":"大颠祖师塔又名舌镜塔、瘗舌冢，位于中国广东省汕头市潮阳区铜盂镇灵山寺后。创建于唐长庆四年（824年），是一座天竺窣堵坡形式的石造塔，为时该寺主持僧大颠的归葬之处。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E9%A2%A0%E7%A5%96%E5%B8%88%E5%A1%94","revisionId":93460981,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93460981","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}